  "ingredients": [
    "1 1/2 cup almond flour",
    "1/4 cup erythritol",
    "1/2 teaspoon baking powder",
    "1/4 cup butter (salted)",
    "1/2 cup pumpkin puree",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "25 drop liquid stevia",
    "1 large egg",
    "2 teaspoon erythritol",
    "1 teaspoon pumpkin pie spice"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350F. Add the almond flour, erythritol, and baking powder to a mixing bowl and combine well.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7613.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, combine the butter, pumpkin puree, vanilla, and liquid stevia.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7616.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave the mixture for easier mixing if needed. Add the wet ingredients mixture and egg to the almond flour mixture.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7622.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix together well to form a pastelike dough.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7624.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll the dough into small balls and place these on a cookie sheet with a Silpat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7628.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the balls flat and bake for 12–13 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7633.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, run the erythritol and pumpkin pie spice through a spice grinder to create a fine powder for the topping. Let this settle before removing the lid.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2015/11/IMG_7640.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove the cookies from the oven, sprinkle with the topping, and let cool completely before serving.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-pumpkin-snickerdoodle-cookies/#wprm-recipe-51823-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
